WEBVTT

01:02.220 --> 01:04.670
<i>Crap. I'm gonna die.</i>

01:13.090 --> 01:15.380
<i>Give me a break.</i>

01:16.510 --> 01:17.590
<i>I...</i>

01:20.230 --> 01:22.410
<i>I'm supposed to become a 
mithril-class adventurer!</i>

01:53.910 --> 01:54.760
<i>Huh?</i>

01:55.710 --> 02:00.040
<i>Wait, wait. This can't be happening.</i>

02:06.800 --> 02:09.980
<i>This can't be happening!</i>

03:44.760 --> 03:48.780
Episode.01 Unwanted Undead

03:51.970 --> 03:54.010
<i>The day starts early for adventurers.</i>

03:54.400 --> 03:56.720
<i>Which sounds nice,</i>

03:57.190 --> 03:59.770
<i>but the day starts early 
for most poor people.</i>

04:00.300 --> 04:06.650
<i>The only people who sleep until 
noon are nobles, wealthy merchants,</i>

04:06.650 --> 04:08.590
<i>and scholars living disorderly lives.</i>

04:08.590 --> 04:10.160
<i>Maybe that's just my bias talking, though.</i>

04:11.100 --> 04:12.950
<i>But my scholar friend sometimes forget</i>

04:12.950 --> 04:16.530
<i>to sleep for days because they're 
so focused on their research.</i>

04:16.910 --> 04:19.050
<i>I should check in on them soon.</i>

04:19.920 --> 04:24.860
<i>Either way, it's not something a
 low bronze-class adventurer,</i>

04:24.860 --> 04:27.000
<i>born and raised in a town
 too small to be on the map,</i>

04:27.000 --> 04:30.520
<i>Rentt Faina, knows anything about.</i>

04:31.360 --> 04:32.330
Okay.

04:33.650 --> 04:36.240
<i>There's one reason adventurers get up early,</i>

04:36.860 --> 04:39.040
<i>and that's to get good jobs.</i>

04:39.670 --> 04:45.540
<i>The adventurers' guild provides us with 
jobs suitable for our rank and skills.</i>

04:46.350 --> 04:49.960
<i>All manner of jobs are available, 
such as monster extermination,</i>

04:49.960 --> 04:54.430
<i>protection, herb and material gathering, 
and even cleaning muck out of drains.</i>

04:54.430 --> 04:55.730
Hey, Rentt.

04:56.550 --> 04:57.830
Good morning.

04:57.830 --> 05:00.130
Are you going to the Labyrinth of 
The Moon's Reflection again today?

05:00.130 --> 05:02.080
If there aren't any good jobs.

05:02.080 --> 05:04.330
How do you work so hard every day?

05:04.330 --> 05:05.970
Well, see you later.

05:05.970 --> 05:07.330
Good luck.

05:07.330 --> 05:08.670
You, too.

05:07.840 --> 05:08.670
Later.

05:17.600 --> 05:19.830
Guess I'll go to the 
Labyrinth of The Moon's Reflection.

05:21.010 --> 05:25.850
<i>Most adventurers form parties, 
but I generally work solo.</i>

05:26.110 --> 05:30.220
<i>There are a few reasons for that, 
but mostly, it's because I'm not very good.</i>

05:30.990 --> 05:33.400
<i>Even though I've been 
adventuring for ten years,</i>

05:33.400 --> 05:36.790
<i>I'm still only bronze, 
the second lowest rank.</i>

05:47.700 --> 05:50.160
<i>But even I can make a living</i>

05:50.160 --> 05:54.040
<i>hunting monsters and selling magic 
stones and materials to the guild.</i>

05:54.710 --> 05:55.770
Thank you. Come again.

05:56.210 --> 05:59.560
<i>Most of all, I live conscientiously 
for an adventurer.</i>

06:00.310 --> 06:03.090
<i>I've even got an emergency fund.</i>

06:09.760 --> 06:15.690
<i>But in that moment, I lost my prudence 
that's essential to all adventurers...</i>

06:17.030 --> 06:19.290
<i>because in the thoroughly-explored</i>

06:19.290 --> 06:22.350
<i>and completely deserted 
Labyrinth of The Moon's Reflection,</i>

06:23.180 --> 06:25.800
<i>I found something unbelievable.</i>

06:35.900 --> 06:37.140
Could it be?

06:38.560 --> 06:40.220
A secret passageway?

06:45.350 --> 06:47.130
What a discovery!

06:58.270 --> 06:59.550
There's no mistaking it.

07:00.490 --> 07:02.110
This is an unexplored area.

07:03.740 --> 07:07.580
Maybe I'll find some valuable 
magical equipment or weapons.

07:08.100 --> 07:13.070
<i>No, I could make a killing simply 
reporting this news to the guild.</i>

07:14.170 --> 07:17.050
<i>I should've ignored it,</i>

07:17.890 --> 07:22.270
<i>but I went charging right into that 
suspicious and dangerous place alone.</i>

07:23.790 --> 07:25.770
<i>Because I'm a fool.</i>

07:33.620 --> 07:36.690
<i>I found myself facing a dragon.</i>

07:39.140 --> 07:40.710
<i>The greatest of all monsters.</i>

07:40.710 --> 07:42.050
<i>A real dragon.</i>

07:42.480 --> 07:45.590
<i>According to legend, they take many forms,</i>

07:45.590 --> 07:49.070
<i>and some are considerably larger 
than most standard dragons.</i>

07:49.830 --> 07:52.430
<i>Regardless, I realized right away
 that it was a dragon,</i>

07:52.960 --> 07:54.920
<i>even though I'd never seen it before.</i>

07:55.540 --> 07:57.130
<i>Its sheer presence—</i>

07:57.130 --> 07:59.920
<i>the pressure it exerted that 
froze me to the spot—</i>

07:59.920 --> 08:02.050
<i>attested that it was a dragon.</i>

08:02.630 --> 08:05.050
<i>As the thousand-year 
bronze-class adventurer,</i>

08:06.030 --> 08:09.820
<i>I stood no chance against 
such an exceptional creature.</i>

08:13.730 --> 08:16.830
<i>How am I alive after being eaten by a dragon?</i>

08:17.740 --> 08:21.040
<i>No, wait. Am I actually alive?</i>

08:24.600 --> 08:27.140
<i>I'm very obviously a skeleton.</i>

08:28.220 --> 08:32.620
<i>I'm an immortal monster known as an undead,</i>

08:32.620 --> 08:39.030
<i>but a bishop or priest could easily 
destroy me with their purification magic</i>

08:39.830 --> 08:44.660
<i>because undead violate 
the divine providence</i>

08:44.660 --> 08:46.930
<i>that the dead are not meant for this world.</i>

08:47.770 --> 08:51.070
<i>When I think of it that way, 
does that mean I died?</i>

08:51.810 --> 08:54.980
<i>No, I'm still conscious and have my memories.</i>

08:54.980 --> 08:57.140
<i>I should return to town.</i>

09:02.840 --> 09:04.700
<i>No, I can't do that.</i>

09:04.700 --> 09:06.420
<i>I don't want to die yet.</i>

09:06.420 --> 09:09.960
<i>No, wait. I'm already dead, 
so I don't want to be destroyed.</i>

09:10.660 --> 09:12.600
<i>Oh, no! I'm confused!</i>

09:12.600 --> 09:14.950
<i>An adventurer mustn't lose his head!</i>

09:15.730 --> 09:18.580
<i>There's no point in thinking about 
questions I can't answer right now.</i>

09:24.360 --> 09:26.920
<i>The dragon seems to be gone,</i>

09:27.560 --> 09:30.330
<i>but I should start by getting away from here.</i>

09:31.480 --> 09:33.900
<i>These labyrinths can be 
found around the world.</i>

09:33.900 --> 09:37.370
<i>Many researches are trying 
to explain their mysteries,</i>

09:37.370 --> 09:40.420
<i>but no one really knows where 
they come from or how they work.</i>

09:41.070 --> 09:43.750
<i>Labyrinths come in various sizes,</i>

09:43.750 --> 09:46.130
<i>but precious magical equipment and 
treasures slumber within them,</i>

09:46.130 --> 09:48.590
<i>and monsters can be found 
around every corner.</i>

09:49.490 --> 09:52.400
<i>Monsters are mysterious, as well.</i>

09:54.010 --> 09:57.760
<i>Everyone's likely at the Labyrinth of the 
New Moon where there's good money to be had.</i>

09:58.500 --> 10:02.250
<i>In a few days, some solo adventurers 
like me should come here.</i>

10:02.250 --> 10:04.270
<i>I'll try asking them for advice.</i>

10:04.970 --> 10:05.510
<i>Oh!</i>

10:06.090 --> 10:09.090
<i>First I need to figure out 
how I'll talk to them.</i>

10:10.550 --> 10:11.420
<i>Huh?</i>

10:19.780 --> 10:21.600
<i>My body feels heavy.</i>

10:21.600 --> 10:25.850
<i>Maybe because I have no muscles, 
my physical abilities are significantly worse.</i>

10:25.850 --> 10:27.930
<i>I'm even less capable 
than an ordinary person.</i>

10:29.120 --> 10:30.400
<i>That's to be expected.</i>

10:30.400 --> 10:32.670
<i>After all, I'm a skeleton now.</i>

10:33.240 --> 10:37.330
<i>I could defeat them easily as a human, 
but I need to be careful now.</i>

10:39.370 --> 10:41.250
<i>I can't raise my sword!</i>

10:41.250 --> 10:42.300
<i>That's not good!</i>

10:59.610 --> 11:04.230
<i>I shouldn't expect to use fancy sword 
techniques when I'm made of bones.</i>

11:05.270 --> 11:06.950
<i>But what about my other abilities?</i>

11:07.410 --> 11:10.470
<i>All living things draw on their 
vital energy for strength.</i>

11:11.250 --> 11:12.110
<i>Their spirit energy.</i>

11:14.710 --> 11:16.280
<i>It's working.</i>

11:18.670 --> 11:20.970
<i>Right now, you and I are the same.</i>

11:20.970 --> 11:22.540
<i>Our strength is equal.</i>

11:22.780 --> 11:26.290
<i>But my equipment gives me an advantage.</i>

11:26.690 --> 11:30.510
<i>If I use my spirit energy to buff my 
physical abilities and raise my attack power...</i>

11:42.400 --> 11:43.900
<i>Is it still alive?</i>

11:52.590 --> 11:55.530
<i>I'm recovering the spirit 
energy I just expended?</i>

11:56.720 --> 11:58.530
<i>Could it be?</i>

11:59.340 --> 12:02.700
Monsters have a mysterious trait.

12:03.250 --> 12:09.050
With time and experience, 
they evolve into greater beings.

12:09.670 --> 12:11.670
So do humans.

12:11.670 --> 12:13.860
We grow with training.

12:14.290 --> 12:16.390
They're on another level.

12:16.390 --> 12:21.160
For example, a skeleton is 
typically a skeleton forever.

12:21.160 --> 12:24.900
But on rare occasions, 
they evolve into ghouls.

12:24.900 --> 12:25.940
It's known as

12:27.020 --> 12:28.900
existential evolution.

12:29.880 --> 12:31.690
Existential evolution...

12:31.970 --> 12:35.480
Yes. It's one of the 
subjects I'm researching.

12:37.410 --> 12:39.300
<i>Existential evolution, huh?</i>

12:40.010 --> 12:44.770
<i>Ghouls are also undead, but they 
have flesh and are closer to humans.</i>

12:45.220 --> 12:48.760
<i>If I use robes and masks to hide my form, 
I may be able to return to town.</i>

12:49.320 --> 12:52.460
<i>All right. I should aim to achieve 
existential evolution first.</i>

12:53.360 --> 12:57.310
<i>I'll defeat monsters in this 
labyrinth and become a ghoul.</i>

13:05.640 --> 13:07.490
He didn't come today, either.

13:08.610 --> 13:09.650
Oh, well.

13:10.090 --> 13:12.170
I'll make dinner myself.

13:14.580 --> 13:16.370
<i>That's five!</i>

13:18.740 --> 13:21.040
<i>My mobility has been mostly restored.</i>

13:24.270 --> 13:28.500
<i>Anyway, it seems like this light heals me.</i>

13:29.170 --> 13:32.710
<i>Because of it, I can use spirit 
energy during every battle.</i>

13:33.050 --> 13:36.140
<i>I'll try taking on some 
stronger monsters next.</i>

13:43.270 --> 13:47.520
<i>Like skeletons, slimes are 
an archetypal weak monster,</i>

13:47.520 --> 13:49.070
<i>but they mustn't be underestimated.</i>

13:49.650 --> 13:54.310
<i>Physical attacks are less effective 
against amorphous liquid monsters.</i>

13:54.730 --> 13:57.280
<i>Magic is the easy way to beat them,</i>

13:57.280 --> 14:01.140
<i>but unfortunately, I don't have the 
ability to use offensive magic.</i>

14:01.510 --> 14:04.870
<i>The most I can do is start fires 
suitable for domestic tasks.</i>

14:05.420 --> 14:08.340
<i>So I'll have to use physical 
attacks to defeat it.</i>

14:08.340 --> 14:10.210
<i>There are two ways to do it.</i>

14:10.210 --> 14:16.550
<i>Pierce its core, or break apart its 
liquid form until it can't regenerate.</i>

14:16.930 --> 14:19.690
<i>Lacking in both skill and strength,</i>

14:19.690 --> 14:24.300
<i>once a day I can expend my reserves 
of spirit energy to defeat them.</i>

14:24.300 --> 14:27.850
<i>You could say slimes are my greatest enemy.</i>

14:38.830 --> 14:39.780
<i>Huh?</i>

14:40.270 --> 14:43.870
<i>Looks like I got lucky and 
my blade struck its core.</i>

14:44.570 --> 14:47.200
<i>First I'll retrieve its magic stone.</i>

14:48.220 --> 14:52.030
<i>Slimes have the ability 
to launch an Acid Blitz,</i>

14:52.030 --> 14:54.960
<i>but no acid remains in their 
body once they're dead.</i>

14:55.440 --> 14:59.050
<i>In fact, sticking your hand in 
the stuff makes your skin smooth.</i>

14:59.050 --> 15:03.640
<i>Clear slime fluids are used 
to make cosmetics for women.</i>

15:04.990 --> 15:08.260
<i>Surely we don't have to make 
cosmetics out of monsters.</i>

15:08.260 --> 15:12.290
<i>Women's desire for beauty must be endless.</i>

15:13.010 --> 15:16.900
<i>This'll pay for several days at an inn.</i>

15:16.900 --> 15:18.070
<i>Good.</i>

15:24.800 --> 15:26.510
Take care.

15:27.110 --> 15:28.100
Sheila.

15:28.100 --> 15:29.250
Yes?

15:29.250 --> 15:31.830
Has that newbie found a party yet?

15:31.830 --> 15:34.960
Her letter of introduction said 
she lacks combat experience,

15:34.960 --> 15:36.690
but she seems all right with a sword.

15:37.130 --> 15:41.920
There wasn't a suitable opening for them, 
so I was going to ask Rentt,

15:42.680 --> 15:45.050
but he hasn't been back since yesterday.

15:45.600 --> 15:47.350
That's unusual.

15:47.350 --> 15:49.690
He hasn't accepted a long-term job, has he?

15:49.690 --> 15:53.350
No, nothing that would take him out of Maalt.

15:53.980 --> 16:00.940
I told the newbie I'd introduce her to a 
helpful veteran if she waited a few days,

16:01.220 --> 16:03.190
but she seemed pressed for money,

16:03.190 --> 16:05.740
so I told her about the 
Labyrinth of The Moon's Reflection.

16:05.740 --> 16:06.940
That should be fine.

16:07.320 --> 16:10.580
Even a newbie should be able to handle it, 
if they're decent with a swordd.

16:10.580 --> 16:14.040
Right. I did warn her 
not to overdo it, though.

16:18.900 --> 16:23.420
<i>I don't feel sleepy at all, 
and I don't feel hungry, either.</i>

16:23.840 --> 16:26.980
<i>I guess that's obvious since I'm undead.</i>

16:26.980 --> 16:29.390
<i>Anything I ate would probably 
fall to the ground.</i>

16:30.010 --> 16:33.430
<i>I fought all night since I might as well,</i>

16:33.430 --> 16:36.980
<i>but it seems like existential 
evolution takes longer than that.</i>

16:38.020 --> 16:42.130
<i>My physical abilities were significantly 
worse right after I became a skeleton,</i>

16:42.130 --> 16:46.420
<i>but I'm mostly back to normal 
after defeating those monsters.</i>

16:47.130 --> 16:49.410
<i>I tested my spirit energy, 
and it still works.</i>

16:50.670 --> 16:52.200
<i>I can use my mana, too.</i>

16:56.510 --> 17:00.630
<i>I can even use my divinity 
despite being undead.</i>

17:02.240 --> 17:04.480
<i>I don't want to waste it. 
I'll use it on this bread.</i>

17:05.100 --> 17:09.120
<i>In addition to curing injuries and illnesses,</i>

17:09.120 --> 17:14.680
<i>divinity is a useful power that can 
purify water and delay spoiling in food.</i>

17:15.170 --> 17:18.010
<i>Okay. That should make 
it last three more days.</i>

17:18.910 --> 17:22.830
<i>I hope I'll have a body that 
needs bread three days from now.</i>

17:23.880 --> 17:26.090
<i>There's no point in thinking about it.</i>

17:26.090 --> 17:28.330
<i>I should focus on achieving 
existential evolution.</i>

17:28.940 --> 17:33.800
<i>I'll play it safe for a while 
and steadily defeat monsters.</i>

17:35.160 --> 17:36.970
<i>I can beat one or two.</i>

17:37.370 --> 17:39.210
<i>Three would be difficult.</i>

17:39.880 --> 17:41.670
<i>If I encounter four, I'll run.</i>

17:42.000 --> 17:43.500
<i>And more than five...</i>

17:44.110 --> 17:48.590
<i>It's unlikely I'll encounter groups 
that large in this labyrinth,</i>

17:48.590 --> 17:51.730
<i>but if I do, I'm screwed.</i>

17:51.730 --> 17:53.430
<i>That would be the end of me.</i>

17:57.050 --> 17:59.260
<i>I'm so weak.</i>

18:00.740 --> 18:02.860
<i>It's been ten years since 
I became an adventurer.</i>

18:03.370 --> 18:06.530
<i>If you include my training time 
before that, it's been twenty years.</i>

18:06.530 --> 18:10.920
<i>Not only that, but even 
high-ranking adventurers rarely</i>

18:10.920 --> 18:13.990
<i>have spirit energy, mana, and divinity.</i>

18:14.630 --> 18:18.650
<i>I wish I had just one strong power.</i>

18:21.660 --> 18:25.930
<i>I know I'm not cut out to be an adventurer.</i>

18:29.160 --> 18:33.310
<i>Normally, people give up on 
adventuring after a few years</i>

18:33.310 --> 18:37.990
<i>and return to their village 
to farm or find another job.</i>

18:39.750 --> 18:43.120
<i>But I figured as long as I'm alive, 
I'd manage somehow.</i>

18:43.730 --> 18:46.420
<i>I trained every day without fail.</i>

18:47.030 --> 18:50.430
<i>I asked an acquaintance to teach 
me about monsters and magic.</i>

18:51.200 --> 18:53.580
<i>I accepted even the most minor jobs.</i>

18:54.300 --> 18:58.180
<i>I did that for ten years to achieve my dream.</i>

19:00.020 --> 19:02.430
<i>To become a mithril-class adventurer.</i>

19:04.130 --> 19:07.000
<i>Higher than gold- and platinum-class,</i>

19:07.500 --> 19:11.250
<i>not even naturally gifted people 
easily reach the highest rank</i>

19:11.250 --> 19:15.340
<i>of adventurers who have saved entire nations.</i>

19:18.880 --> 19:22.080
<i>I will become mithril-class.</i>

19:22.990 --> 19:25.030
<i>It's what I've lived for.</i>

19:25.900 --> 19:28.990
<i>Becoming a skeleton won't stop me!</i>

19:40.360 --> 19:41.220
<i>Huh?</i>

19:41.650 --> 19:44.790
<i>I'm starting to get stronger 
than I was as a human?</i>

19:59.830 --> 20:01.010
<i>I knew it.</i>

20:01.420 --> 20:02.790
<i>It's not a coincidence.</i>

20:03.380 --> 20:05.600
<i>I'm getting stronger.</i>

20:06.580 --> 20:10.190
<i>I can sell these materials. 
I should gather some more.</i>

20:10.610 --> 20:14.140
<i>I'm lucky to acquire more clear slime fluid.</i>

20:14.140 --> 20:17.260
<i>Slimes are fairly gross after 
they've eaten something,</i>

20:17.260 --> 20:19.080
<i>so their fluids can't be sold.</i>

20:28.090 --> 20:30.550
<i>Wha— What's happening?</i>

21:07.850 --> 21:09.320
<i>I'm a ghoul.</i>

21:09.990 --> 21:14.010
<i>I'm a creepy dried-out corpse, 
but I have flesh.</i>

21:14.440 --> 21:16.470
<i>This is major progress.</i>

21:16.850 --> 21:20.950
<i>If I keep working hard, I might be able 
to become even higher ranking undead.</i>

21:21.290 --> 21:22.350
<i>That's right.</i>

21:22.350 --> 21:25.430
<i>Vampires practically look human.</i>

21:25.430 --> 21:28.400
<i>Oh, right. I have a fleshy body now.</i>

21:35.950 --> 21:37.930
<i>Okay, I can make noises.</i>

21:39.770 --> 21:45.400
Hello... hello...

21:45.400 --> 21:49.580
Good morning...

21:52.660 --> 21:54.550
<i>I'll have to practice.</i>

21:55.160 --> 21:59.880
Hello... hello...

21:59.880 --> 22:03.930
I am Rentt...
